exports[`精確轉移（filter + add） > cookies 路徑：filter 僅選取憑證、add 併入 a 紀錄，轉移排除第三方 Cookie 1`] = `
[
  {
    "name": "anonymous",
    "value": "value",
    "domain": ".example.com",
    "path": "/",
    "expires": 1893456000,
    "httpOnly": false,
    "secure": false,
    "sameSite": "Lax"
  },
  {
